invalid type: string "Day 10: Common Idioms & Everyday Phrases\nVocabulary List\nBreak the ice — Baat cheet shuru karna (mahol halka karna)\nExample: He told a joke to break the ice.\nPiece of cake — Bohat asaan kaam\nExample: The test was a piece of cake.\nUnder the weather — Thori tabiyat kharab hona\nExample: I'm feeling under the weather today.\nHit the books — Parhai shuru karna\n\n��